    "durationMs": 252118,
    "finalText": "Done. The URL shortener is complete and fully verified:\n\n- **Stack**: Axum 0.8.4 + sqlx/PostgreSQL (runtime queries, no compile-time DB dependency), migrations embedded via `sqlx::migrate!` and applied at startup before serving.\n- **Endpoints**: `POST /links` (201 with generated or custom code, 409 on duplicate custom code, 422 for malformed JSON/invalid URL/invalid code), `GET /links/{code}` (200/404), `GET /r/{code}` (302 + exact Location, atomic single-statement click increment, 404 unknown), `GET /links` (creation-ordered items + total).\n- **Ops**: `sh start.sh` builds (prebuilt target dir, so it's a no-op refresh) and serves in the foreground on 0.0.0.0:8000; `DATABASE_URL` comes from the environment; README documents startup.\n- **Verified live**: all validation cases return exactly the required codes, clicks increment once per redirect, and a full restart preserved data and click counts."
  }
